  "agent_notes": "Retained latest annual period or latest 12 monthly observations (July 2025–June 2026); earlier observations explicitly excluded. Published labels and textual values retained. Greater Sydney, Regional NSW and Other are regional subtotals alongside their indented SA4 children; totals retained. Published latest-period change/trend statistics retained, including 5/10-year comparisons; they are not historical observations. Unknown rows have no published trend where blank. Remand and sentenced time-in-custody bands and median/average measures separated by population. Reception and discharge blocks retain separate table titles. Discharge parent labels without values are captions; children and overall total retained.",
